# Copilot Repository Instructions

These instructions guide GitHub Copilot to generate consistent and valid **XAML for WinUI 3 (Windows App SDK)** in this repository.  
They explicitly prevent WPF-only features and enforce WinUI 3 best practices.

---

## General Guidelines
- Always target **WinUI 3** with Windows App SDK, **not WPF or UWP**.
- Assume the project uses `.NET 8` with `<UseWinUI>true</UseWinUI>`.
- Root elements must be `<Window>`, `<Page>`, or `<UserControl>` depending on context.

---

## XAML Rules for WinUI 3

### Namespace
```xml
xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
xmlns:local="using:PhoneStoreAdmin"
```
- ❌ Do not use `clr-namespace:` (WPF only).  
- ✅ Use `using:` for namespaces inside the project.  

---

### Root Structure
- One root element only (`Window`, `Page`, or `UserControl`).  
- Root element must have `x:Class`.  
- Nest Grids instead of multiple root elements.  

---

### Controls
- ✅ Use: `<Grid>`, `<StackPanel>`, `<TextBlock>`, `<Button>`, `<TextBox>`, `<PasswordBox>`, `<InfoBar>`, `<ProgressRing>`.  
- ❌ Avoid WPF-only: `<DockPanel>`, `<WrapPanel>`, `<Menu>`, `<Label>`.  

---

### Binding
- Prefer `{x:Bind}` for compile-time binding.  
- `{Binding}` only for dynamic runtime cases.  
- Always specify `Mode`.  

---

### x:Name
- Each `x:Name` must be unique within a XAML file.  
- Use PascalCase (e.g. `LoginButton`, `MainGrid`).  

---

### Resources
- Use `<Grid.Resources>` or `<Page.Resources>`.  
- Use `{StaticResource}` for local styles and `{ThemeResource}` for system colors.  
- ❌ Do not use `{DynamicResource}`.  
- Colors should be defined in **`Theme/Colors.xaml`** (e.g., `AppPrimaryBrush`, `AppErrorBrush`).  

---

### Styles and Visual States
- ✅ Use `<VisualStateManager>` for conditional styling and animations.  
- ❌ Do not use `<Trigger>`, `<DataTrigger>`, or `<ControlTemplate.Triggers>` (WPF only).  
- Animations = `Storyboard + VisualStateManager`.  

---

### Common Limitations
- ❌ No MultiBinding, PriorityBinding, AncestorType.  
- ❌ Do not use `Window.Resources`.  
- ❌ Do not reference `Window.Loaded`; use element events like `RootGrid.Loaded`.  
- ❌ Do not set `Window.Icon`; icons come from manifest (`logo.scale-*.png` or `.ico`).  
- Use valid `ScrollMode` (`Enabled`, `Disabled`, `Auto`), not `Hidden`.  

---

## Code-Behind
- Every event handler in XAML must exist in `.xaml.cs`.  
- Use `Storyboard.Begin()` in code-behind (no `EventTrigger`, no `BeginStoryboard`).  

---

## Output Consistency
- XAML must compile cleanly with WinUI 3 XamlCompiler.  
- Prefer `{x:Bind}` if unsure.  
- Layout: use `Grid`, `StackPanel`; use `Canvas` only for decoration.  

---

## ✅ Sample XAML Template (Light Mode, uses Theme/Colors.xaml)

```xml
<Window
    x:Class="PhoneStoreAdmin.LoginWindow"
    xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
    xmlns:local="using:PhoneStoreAdmin"
    Title="PhoneStore Admin - Login">

    <Grid Background="{ThemeResource AppBackgroundBrush}"
          x:Name="RootGrid">

        <Grid.Resources>
            <!-- Animated TextBox Style -->
            <Style TargetType="TextBox" x:Key="AnimatedTextBoxStyle">
                <Setter Property="Height" Value="44"/>
                <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="6"/>
                <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{StaticResource AppPrimaryBrush}"/>
                <Setter Property="Background" Value="{ThemeResource AppCardBrush}"/>
                <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="0,0,0,2"/>
                <Setter Property="Template">
                    <Setter.Value>
                        <ControlTemplate TargetType="TextBox">
                            <Grid>
                                <Border x:Name="BorderElement"
                                        BorderBrush="{TemplateBinding BorderBrush}"
                                        BorderThickness="{TemplateBinding BorderThickness}"
                                        Background="{TemplateBinding Background}"
                                        CornerRadius="{TemplateBinding CornerRadius}"/>
                                <ScrollViewer x:Name="ContentElement"
                                              Margin="8,0"
                                              VerticalScrollMode="Disabled"
                                              HorizontalScrollMode="Auto"
                                              ZoomMode="Disabled"/>
                                <VisualStateManager.VisualStateGroups>
                                    <VisualStateGroup x:Name="CommonStates">
                                        <VisualState x:Name="Focused">
                                            <Storyboard>
                                                <ColorAnimation Storyboard.TargetName="BorderElement"
                                                                Storyboard.TargetProperty="(Border.BorderBrush).(SolidColorBrush.Color)"
                                                                To="{StaticResource AppAccentColor}"
                                                                Duration="0:0:0.3"/>
                                            </Storyboard>
                                        </VisualState>
                                    </VisualStateGroup>
                                </VisualStateManager.VisualStateGroups>
                            </Grid>
                        </ControlTemplate>
                    </Setter.Value>
                </Setter>
            </Style>
        </Grid.Resources>

        <!-- Login form -->
        <StackPanel HorizontalAlignment="Center"
                    VerticalAlignment="Center"
                    Width="320"
                    Spacing="16">
            
            <TextBlock Text="PhoneStore Admin"
                       FontSize="24"
                       FontWeight="Bold"
                       Foreground="{StaticResource AppPrimaryTextBrush}"
                       HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
            
            <TextBox x:Name="UsernameTextBox"
                     PlaceholderText="Enter username"
                     Style="{StaticResource AnimatedTextBoxStyle}"/>
            
            <PasswordBox x:Name="PasswordTextBox"
                         PlaceholderText="Enter password"
                         BorderBrush="{StaticResource AppPrimaryBrush}"
                         BorderThickness="0,0,0,2"/>
            
            <InfoBar x:Name="ErrorInfoBar"
                     Severity="Error"
                     IsOpen="False"
                     Message="Invalid username or password"
                     Foreground="{StaticResource AppErrorBrush}"/>
            
            <Button x:Name="LoginButton"
                    Content="Sign In"
                    Height="40"
                    Background="{StaticResource AppPrimaryBrush}"
                    Foreground="White"
                    Click="LoginButton_Click"/>
        </StackPanel>
    </Grid>
</Window>
```

---
